    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>2D action role-playing game</strong> blends <strong>platforming</strong> exploration with a <strong>turn-based strategic button timed battle system</strong>, offering an immersive combat experience that demands both strategy and reflexes. With a deep narrative, diverse character abilities, and a tactical battle system, players will uncover the mysteries of the past while shaping the destiny of their fallen warriors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dying in a war, Rosetta awakens to find herself reborn with the divine power of a Valkyrie. With no memory of how or why she was granted this fate, she embarks on a journey alongside her Einherjars (warriors bound to her service) to uncover the secrets behind her resurrection. As she battles formidable foes, navigates political schemes, and unravels ancient mysteries, she must reconcile her existence as both a human and a goddess, walking the fine line between mortality and divinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/0f854fd19334e2c482b981fc5e8f1c9a.poster.avif?t=1748547937\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/0f854fd19334e2c482b981fc5e8f1c9a.webm?t=1748547937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/0f854fd19334e2c482b981fc5e8f1c9a.mp4?t=1748547937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>2D RPG platformer</strong> offers fast-paced exploration and dynamic turn-based combat infused with <strong>button-mashing mechanics</strong>. Players will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control a party of unique characters</strong>, each with their own abilities, stats, and combat roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in high-intensity battles</strong>, where well-timed inputs determine attack success, skill execution, and defensive maneuvers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/6711741cb2c275cf638b52431567e7c5.poster.avif?t=1748547937\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/6711741cb2c275cf638b52431567e7c5.webm?t=1748547937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/6711741cb2c275cf638b52431567e7c5.mp4?t=1748547937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage inventory, skills, and burst attacks</strong>, utilizing an in-depth menu system that includes <strong>equipment, items, and status effects</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize between class and subclass combinations</strong>, customizing the party\u2019s strengths to adapt to different enemies and battle scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a deep narrative</strong> through exploration, character interactions, and battle-driven storytelling.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a balance of skillful execution and tactical decision-making, players must master both combat and strategy to guide Rosetta and her Einherjars through their perilous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>2D action role-playing game</strong> blends <strong>platforming</strong> exploration with a <strong>turn-based strategic button timed battle system</strong>, offering an immersive combat experience that demands both strategy and reflexes. With a deep narrative, diverse character abilities, and a tactical battle system, players will uncover the mysteries of the past while shaping the destiny of their fallen warriors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After dying in a war, Rosetta awakens to find herself reborn with the divine power of a Valkyrie. With no memory of how or why she was granted this fate, she embarks on a journey alongside her Einherjars (warriors bound to her service) to uncover the secrets behind her resurrection. As she battles formidable foes, navigates political schemes, and unravels ancient mysteries, she must reconcile her existence as both a human and a goddess, walking the fine line between mortality and divinity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/0f854fd19334e2c482b981fc5e8f1c9a.poster.avif?t=1748547937\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/0f854fd19334e2c482b981fc5e8f1c9a.webm?t=1748547937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/0f854fd19334e2c482b981fc5e8f1c9a.mp4?t=1748547937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>2D RPG platformer</strong> offers fast-paced exploration and dynamic turn-based combat infused with <strong>button-mashing mechanics</strong>. Players will:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Control a party of unique characters</strong>, each with their own abilities, stats, and combat roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engage in high-intensity battles</strong>, where well-timed inputs determine attack success, skill execution, and defensive maneuvers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/6711741cb2c275cf638b52431567e7c5.poster.avif?t=1748547937\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/6711741cb2c275cf638b52431567e7c5.webm?t=1748547937\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3473130/extras/6711741cb2c275cf638b52431567e7c5.mp4?t=1748547937\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage inventory, skills, and burst attacks</strong>, utilizing an in-depth menu system that includes <strong>equipment, items, and status effects</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategize between class and subclass combinations</strong>, customizing the party\u2019s strengths to adapt to different enemies and battle scenarios.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a deep narrative</strong> through exploration, character interactions, and battle-driven storytelling.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a balance of skillful execution and tactical decision-making, players must master both combat and strategy to guide Rosetta and her Einherjars through their perilous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
